---
import GameLayout from '../../layouts/GameLayout.astro';
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';

const gameEntry = await getEntry('games', 'soundboard');
const data = gameEntry?.data || {
  title: '방송 효과음 키패드 (사운드보드)',
  tagline: '치지직·유튜브·SOOP 생방송을 위한 저지연 원클릭 효과음 패드',
  description: '설치 및 로그인 없이 0초 만에 브라우저에서 실행되는 무료 방송용 사운드보드. 땡, 딩동댕, 두둥탁, 삐-, 쾅, 풀벌레, 드럼롤, 팡파르, 박수 갈채 등 9가지 필수 방송 사운드를 숫자 키패드로 즉각 재생하세요.',
  icon: '🔊',
  category: 'stream',
  badge: '🔥 스트리머 필수',
  players: '스트리머 1인 (생방송)',
  playTime: '즉시 재생 (무제한)',
  controls: [
    '숫자 키패드(Num 1~9) 또는 상단 숫자키(1~9)로 효과음 즉시 재생',
    '스페이스바(Space) 또는 ESC 키로 모든 효과음 즉시 긴급 정지',
    '0(Q) 또는 .(W) 키로 나만의 커스텀 사운드(슬롯 A, B) 재생',
    '상단 마스터 볼륨 슬라이더 및 동시/단일 컷 재생 모드 토글',
    '집중 모드(Focus) 및 OBS 브라우저 소스(?stream=true) 지원'
  ],
  rules: [
    '외부 오디오 다운로드 없이 Web Audio API로 0ms 초저지연 합성 재생됩니다.',
    '동시 재생(Overlap) 모드는 소리가 겹치며, 단일(Cut) 모드는 새 소리가 이전 소리를 즉시 컷합니다.',
    '커스텀 슬롯에 원하는 MP3/WAV 파일을 드래그하여 방송 시그니처 사운드로 활용할 수 있습니다.'
  ],
  faqItems: [
    {
      q: 'OBS 방송 화면이나 보조 모니터에서 리모컨처럼 사용할 수 있나요?',
      a: '네! 상단의 [🎥 OBS 복사] 버튼을 누르면 불필요한 UI 없이 패드만 깔끔하게 노출되는 투명 오버레이 URL(?stream=true)이 복사됩니다. OBS 브라우저 소스나 보조 모니터에 띄워두고 편리하게 사용하세요.'
    },
    {
      q: '키보드 숫자패드로 소리가 안 날 때는 어떻게 하나요?',
      a: '키보드의 "Num Lock" 키가 켜져 있는지 확인해 주세요. 키패드뿐만 아니라 키보드 상단의 일반 숫자 1~9 키로도 동일하게 즉각 재생됩니다.'
    },
    {
      q: '내가 등록한 커스텀 MP3 파일이 서버로 전송되나요?',
      a: '전혀 전송되지 않습니다! 등록된 오디오는 100% 스트리머 본인의 컴퓨터 브라우저 메모리에만 로컬 디코딩되어 안전하며, 저작권이나 데이터 유출 걱정 없이 방송에 사용하실 수 있습니다.'
    }
  ]
};
---

<GameLayout
  title={data.title}
  description={data.description}
  tagline={data.tagline}
  icon={data.icon}
  category={data.category}
  badge={data.badge}
  players={data.players}
  playTime={data.playTime}
  controls={data.controls}
  rules={data.rules}
  faqItems={data.faqItems}
  layoutMode="full"
  hideStageHeader={true}
  hideFooter={false}
>
  <div class="soundboard-root" id="soundboard-root">
    <!-- Top Streamer Control Bar -->
    <header class="sb-header">
      <div class="sb-brand">
        <span class="sb-brand-icon">🔊</span>
        <div class="sb-brand-info">
          <h1 class="sb-title">BROADCAST SOUNDBOARD</h1>
          <p class="sb-sub">Web Audio Engine &bull; Zero Latency</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Live Master Controls -->
      <div class="sb-master-controls">
        <!-- Master Volume -->
        <div class="control-group volume-group">
          <label for="master-volume" class="control-label">
            <span class="ctrl-icon" id="vol-icon">🔊</span>
            <span class="label-text">MASTER</span>
            <span class="vol-value" id="vol-display">100%</span>
          </label>
          <input 
            type="range" 
            id="master-volume" 
            class="vol-slider" 
            min="0" 
            max="150" 
            value="100" 
            step="1"
            aria-label="Master Volume"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Polyphony Mode Toggle -->
        <div class="control-group polyphony-group">
          <span class="control-label">
            <span class="ctrl-icon">🔀</span>
            <span class="label-text">PLAYBACK</span>
          </span>
          <div class="toggle-pill-wrap">
            <button type="button" class="poly-btn active" id="btn-mode-overlap" data-mode="overlap" title="여러 소리가 동시에 겹쳐서 재생됩니다">
              OVERLAP
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="poly-btn" id="btn-mode-cut" data-mode="cut" title="새 소리가 재생되면 이전 소리를 즉시 컷합니다">
              CUT
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Panic Stop Button -->
        <button type="button" class="panic-stop-btn" id="panic-stop-btn" title="모든 재생 중인 효과음을 즉시 긴급 정지합니다 (Space / Esc)">
          <span class="panic-icon">🛑</span>
          <span class="panic-text">PANIC STOP</span>
          <kbd class="panic-kbd">SPACE</kbd>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Stream Utilities (OBS, Fullscreen, Focus) -->
      <div class="sb-stream-actions">
        <button type="button" class="action-btn-item" id="btn-focus-mode" title="헤더와 여백을 숨기고 패드만 집중 노출합니다">
          <span class="act-icon">📺</span>
          <span class="act-text">집중 모드</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="action-btn-item" id="btn-obs-copy" title="OBS 브라우저 소스용 투명 오버레이 링크를 복사합니다">
          <span class="act-icon">🎥</span>
          <span class="act-text">OBS 복사</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="action-btn-item" id="btn-fullscreen" title="전체화면 전환">
          <span class="act-icon">⛶</span>
          <span class="act-text">전체화면</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Real-time Oscilloscope / Spectrum Ribbon -->
    <div class="visualizer-container">
      <canvas id="visualizer-canvas" class="visualizer-canvas" height="36"></canvas>
      <div class="visualizer-status">
        <span class="status-dot active" id="audio-status-dot"></span>
        <span class="status-text" id="audio-status-text">AUDIO ENGINE READY</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Soundboard Section -->
    <main class="sb-main-stage">
      <!-- 3x3 Primary Tactical Grid -->
      <div class="pad-grid-3x3" id="pad-grid" role="region" aria-label="3x3 Soundboard Pads">
        <!-- Pad 1 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-danger" data-pad="1" data-key="1" id="pad-1">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 1</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">❌</div>
            <div class="pad-title">땡! (오답 버저)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Harsh Low Buzzer</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 2 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-success" data-pad="2" data-key="2" id="pad-2">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 2</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">🔔</div>
            <div class="pad-title">딩동댕! (정답 차임)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Crystal Bell Chime</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 3 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-primary" data-pad="3" data-key="3" id="pad-3">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 3</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 3</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">🥁</div>
            <div class="pad-title">두둥탁! (펀치라인)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Ba-Dum-Tss Punchline</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 4 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-warning" data-pad="4" data-key="4" id="pad-4">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 4</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 4</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">⚠️</div>
            <div class="pad-title">삐-! (자체 검열음)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">1kHz Pure Censor Tone</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 5 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-danger" data-pad="5" data-key="5" id="pad-5">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 5</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 5</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">💥</div>
            <div class="pad-title">쾅! (충격 임팩트)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Deep Explosion Boom</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 6 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-ambient" data-pad="6" data-key="6" id="pad-6">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 6</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 6</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">🦗</div>
            <div class="pad-title">풀벌레 (적막/싸늘)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Awkward Silence Chirps</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 7 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-cyan" data-pad="7" data-key="7" id="pad-7">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 7</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 7</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">🎪</div>
            <div class="pad-title">드럼롤 (긴장감)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Roll with Crash Hit</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 8 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-gold" data-pad="8" data-key="8" id="pad-8">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 8</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 8</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">🎺</div>
            <div class="pad-title">팡파르 (승리/축하)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Victorious Brass Fanfare</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>

        <!-- Pad 9 -->
        <button type="button" class="sound-pad pad-violet" data-pad="9" data-key="9" id="pad-9">
          <div class="pad-header">
            <span class="pad-badge">PAD 9</span>
            <span class="pad-hotkey">NUM 9</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-body">
            <div class="pad-icon-wrap">👏</div>
            <div class="pad-title">박수 갈채 (환호)</div>
            <div class="pad-sub">Crowd Applause Burst</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pad-ripple"></div>
          <div class="pad-glow"></div>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Extra Custom Slots (Slot A & Slot B) -->
      <div class="custom-slots-panel">
        <div class="custom-panel-header">
          <span class="panel-icon">📂</span>
          <span class="panel-title">커스텀 방송 사운드 슬롯 (내 MP3/WAV 파일 등록)</span>
          <span class="panel-hint">드래그 앤 드롭 또는 파일 선택 &bull; 브라우저 로컬 저장</span>
        </div>

        <div class="custom-slots-grid">
          <!-- Custom Slot A -->
          <div class="custom-slot-card" id="slot-card-0" data-slot="0">
            <div class="slot-top">
              <span class="slot-badge">CUSTOM SLOT A</span>
              <span class="slot-hotkey">NUM 0 / Q</span>
            </div>
            <div class="slot-content" id="slot-content-0">
              <div class="slot-empty-view">
                <span class="slot-upload-icon">📁</span>
                <span class="slot-prompt">오디오 파일 드래그 또는 클릭</span>
                <span class="slot-formats">MP3, WAV, OGG, M4A 지원</span>
              </div>
              <div class="slot-loaded-view hidden">
                <span class="slot-sound-icon">🎵</span>
                <div class="slot-sound-info">
                  <div class="slot-sound-name" id="slot-name-0">custom-audio.mp3</div>
                  <div class="slot-sound-meta" id="slot-meta-0">0.0s &bull; Ready</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="slot-clear-btn" data-slot="0" title="사운드 삭제">✕</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <input type="file" id="file-input-0" class="file-hidden-input" accept="audio/*" data-slot="0" />
            <button type="button" class="slot-trigger-btn" id="btn-play-slot-0" data-slot="0" title="커스텀 사운드 A 재생 (0 또는 Q)">
              ▶ 재생 (PLAY)
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Custom Slot B -->
          <div class="custom-slot-card" id="slot-card-1" data-slot="1">
            <div class="slot-top">
              <span class="slot-badge">CUSTOM SLOT B</span>
              <span class="slot-hotkey">NUM . / W</span>
            </div>
            <div class="slot-content" id="slot-content-1">
              <div class="slot-empty-view">
                <span class="slot-upload-icon">📁</span>
                <span class="slot-prompt">오디오 파일 드래그 또는 클릭</span>
                <span class="slot-formats">MP3, WAV, OGG, M4A 지원</span>
              </div>
              <div class="slot-loaded-view hidden">
                <span class="slot-sound-icon">🎵</span>
                <div class="slot-sound-info">
                  <div class="slot-sound-name" id="slot-name-1">custom-audio.mp3</div>
                  <div class="slot-sound-meta" id="slot-meta-1">0.0s &bull; Ready</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="slot-clear-btn" data-slot="1" title="사운드 삭제">✕</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <input type="file" id="file-input-1" class="file-hidden-input" accept="audio/*" data-slot="1" />
            <button type="button" class="slot-trigger-btn" id="btn-play-slot-1" data-slot="1" title="커스텀 사운드 B 재생 (. 또는 W)">
              ▶ 재생 (PLAY)
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Streamer Shortcuts Floating Cheat-strip -->
    <footer class="sb-footer-bar">
      <div class="footer-tip">
        <span class="tip-kbd">1 ~ 9</span> 기본 효과음
      </div>
      <div class="footer-tip">
        <span class="tip-kbd">0 / Q</span> 커스텀 A
      </div>
      <div class="footer-tip">
        <span class="tip-kbd">. / W</span> 커스텀 B
      </div>
      <div class="footer-tip">
        <span class="tip-kbd danger">SPACE / ESC</span> 긴급 컷 (All Stop)
      </div>
      <div class="footer-tip obs-tip">
        <span class="tip-tag">OBS</span> ?stream=true 파라미터로 투명 오버레이 지원
      </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Browser Autoplay Policy Interaction Prompt Overlay -->
    <div class="audio-unlock-overlay active" id="audio-unlock-overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="오디오 엔진 활성화">
      <div class="unlock-modal-box">
        <div class="unlock-icon-pulse">
          <span class="unlock-icon">🔊</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="unlock-title">방송용 오디오 엔진 활성화</h2>
        <p class="unlock-desc">
          브라우저의 자동 재생 정책에 따라 첫 1회 클릭이 필요합니다.<br/>
          화면을 클릭하면 <strong>0초 저지연 오디오 엔진</strong>이 즉시 가동됩니다.
        </p>
        <button type="button" class="unlock-action-btn" id="unlock-start-btn">
          ⚡ 클릭하여 사운드보드 시작
        </button>
        <span class="unlock-sub-hint">아무 키나 키패드를 눌러도 즉시 시작됩니다</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Toast Notification Notification -->
    <div id="sb-toast" class="sb-toast" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </div>
</GameLayout>

<style>
  /* ==========================================================================
     Cyberpunk Stream-Deck Aesthetics (#0f1117 / #161b22, #00ffcc, #7928ca)
     ========================================================================== */
  .soundboard-root {
    --bg-base: #0a0d14;
    --bg-card: #121824;
    --bg-pad: #161f30;
    --border-color: #26334d;
    --border-active: #00ffcc;
    --neon-cyan: #00ffcc;
    --neon-pink: #ff007a;
    --neon-violet: #7928ca;
    --neon-gold: #ffbe0b;
    --neon-blue: #00b4d8;
    --text-main: #f1f5f9;
    --text-muted: #8b9bb4;
    --text-dim: #546582;

    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Pretendard Variable", sans-serif;
    color: var(--text-main);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    user-select: none;
    position: relative;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 120px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* Fullscreen & Focus Mode Adjustments */
  .soundboard-root.focus-mode {
    max-width: 100vw;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Header & Master Controls
     -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .sb-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: rgba(18, 24, 36, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .sb-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .sb-brand-icon {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px var(--neon-cyan));
  }

  .sb-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00ffcc 0%, #38bdf8 50%, #c084fc 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .sb-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .sb-master-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .control-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .control-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
